[big snip of patches]

> 
> None of the three sets of changes I've looked at appears to really
> do much for A or F, unless I'm missing something.  So perhaps
> those are the areas that someone should focus on, if someone were
> to undertake to produce a patch to seriously improve Gehennom.
> 
> With that prelude, then, I'm going to start brainstorming.  I don't
